soal:
Create an automated program (algorithm/code) to determine a student's graduation status based on final score and attendance percentage, with the following conditions:
(a) minimum final score of 75;
(b) minimum attendance of 80%;
(c) if the score is between 70-74, the student is still declared to pass if attendance is above 90%;
(d) if any condition is not met, the student is declared not to pass.
Design the algorithm (nested if), then test it with several example values.
